# REQUIRED, with no defaults. Docker Compose sets both for the container.
# Running outside Docker, export them in your shell: uvicorn does not read this file.
#
# Logging verbosity: DEBUG, INFO, WARNING or ERROR.
# LOG_LEVEL=
#
# Where the built main/ distribution's flat lib/ folder lives: Compose points it at the
# gradle-builder volume. Run against a sibling checkout, point it at that checkout's
# build/install/com.mddoai/lib after `cd main && ./gradlew installDist`.
# EXECUTION_LIB_DIR=
